{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Guess the mystery station." : {
      "comment" : "First rule of Trackdown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Raad het geheime station." } }
      }
    },
    "Each guess shows the fastest train journey from your station to the mystery station." : {
      "comment" : "Second rule: guesses produce route clues.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Elke gok toont de snelste treinreis van jouw station naar het geheime station." } }
      }
    },
    "Use the travel times and changes to narrow it down. A new station every day!" : {
      "comment" : "Third rule: use the clues to solve the daily puzzle.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Gebruik de reistijden en overstappen om dichterbij te komen. Elke dag een nieuw station!" } }
      }
    },
    "For example" : {
      "comment" : "Heading above the example train journey clue.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bijvoorbeeld" } }
      }
    },
    "From Maastricht, ride an Intercity for 2 hours and 2 minutes, change at a hidden station with a 6-minute wait, then ride another Intercity for 17 minutes. The mystery station is at the end of the line." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the Maastricht example clue, including the hidden change and destination.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Reis vanuit Maastricht 2 uur en 2 minuten met een Intercity, stap over op een verborgen station met 6 minuten wachttijd en reis daarna nog 17 minuten met een Intercity. Het geheime station staat aan het einde van de lijn." } }
      }
    },
    "Guess a change station to reveal its name in earlier clues." : {
      "comment" : "Explains how guessing a hidden change station updates earlier clues.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Raad een overstapstation om de naam in eerdere aanwijzingen te onthullen." } }
      }
    },
    "Play today's station" : {
      "comment" : "Dismisses How to play so the player can start the daily puzzle.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Speel het station van vandaag" } }
      }
    },
    "Privacy" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the privacy settings screen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Privacy" } }
      }
    },
    "Privacy settings" : {
      "comment" : "Opens Privacy from How to play.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Privacyinstellingen" } }
      }
    },
    "Share usage data" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the analytics consent toggle.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Gebruiksgegevens delen" } }
      }
    },
    "Anonymous, through PostHog" : {
      "comment" : "Subtitle of the analytics toggle.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Anoniem, via PostHog" } }
      }
    },
    "On. Thanks for helping improve Trackdown." : {
      "comment" : "Status under the analytics toggle when enabled.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Aan. Bedankt dat je helpt Trackdown te verbeteren." } }
      }
    },
    "Off. You can turn this on or off at any time." : {
      "comment" : "Status under the analytics toggle when disabled.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Uit. Je kunt dit op elk moment aan- of uitzetten." } }
      }
    },
    "Why ask?" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the explanation of usage data.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Waarom deze vraag?" } }
      }
    },
    "Trackdown is a hobby project without ads. Anonymous usage data helps me understand how people play and where they get stuck, so I can improve the game. Nothing is sold. If you turn this off, the game works exactly the same." : {
      "comment" : "Explains why the player is asked to share anonymous usage data.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Trackdown is een hobbyproject zonder advertenties. Anonieme gebruiksgegevens helpen me begrijpen hoe mensen spelen en waar ze vastlopen, zodat ik het spel kan verbeteren. Er wordt niets verkocht. Als je dit uitzet, werkt het spel precies hetzelfde." } }
      }
    },
    "Privacy policy" : {
      "comment" : "Opens the Trackdown privacy policy in Safari.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Privacybeleid" } }
      }
    },
    "Terms of use" : {
      "comment" : "Opens the Trackdown terms in Safari.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Gebruiksvoorwaarden" } }
      }
    },
    "%@, streak %lld" : {
      "comment" : "Under a network's name: what it covers, then the current streak, such as \"All railway stations, streak 7\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$@, reeks %2$lld" } }
      }
    },
    "%lld guesses" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label of a chart row of games solved in this many guesses, more than one.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%lld gokken" } }
      }
    },
    "%lld of %lld guesses" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label of an archive row's result, such as \"4 of 6 guesses\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$lld van %2$lld gokken" } }
      }
    },
    "%lld/%lld" : {
      "comment" : "Result at the end of an archive row: guesses used of the guesses allowed, such as 4/6.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$lld/%2$lld" } }
      }
    },
    "%lldh%@" : {
      "comment" : "A trip time in a shared result, such as 2h25. The arguments are hours and the minutes, padded to two digits.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$lldu%2$@" } }
      }
    },
    "1 guess" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label of the chart row of games solved in one guess.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "1 gok" } }
      }
    },
    "All National Rail stations" : {
      "comment" : "Under Great Britain in the network list: the stations the game covers.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Alle National Rail-stations" } }
      }
    },
    "All railway stations" : {
      "comment" : "Under Netherlands in the network list: the stations the game covers.",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Alle treinstations" } }
